{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":488333,"name":"Kyles Cousin","username":"Kyles_Cousin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kyles_cousin/{size}/120491_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-10T18:27:57.163Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488333-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488333-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488333-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488333-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoth RPM links on this page are broken: \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/download/bot\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eCursor · Download Grok Bot\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488333-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488333-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick on the RPM links\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488333-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488333-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDownload RPM file to install GrokBot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488333-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488333-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLinux\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488333-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488333-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFedora Linux\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488333-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488333-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-10T18:55:12.655Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":5.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171281,"topic_slug":"linux-rpm-links-for-grokbot-not-working","display_username":"Kyles Cousin","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://cursor.com/download/bot","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cursor · Download Grok Bot","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137215,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/linux-rpm-links-for-grokbot-not-working/171281/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":488372,"name":"Kevin Neilson","username":"kevinn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-10T19:19:25.660Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/kyles_cousin\"\u003e@Kyles_Cousin\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou’re right, both RPM links on that page currently point to an old filename, which is why they fail. The packages themselves are fine, and I’ve passed the page issue along to the team.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere are direct working links for the current version (0.47.0):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ex64: \u003ca href=\"https://downloads.cursor.com/grokbot/stable/c1e7d7a46549956d25f53e9c0b9f59666e03aa3a/linux/x64/grok-bot-0.47.0-1.x86_64.rpm\"\u003ehttps://downloads.cursor.com/grokbot/stable/c1e7d7a46549956d25f53e9c0b9f59666e03aa3a/linux/x64/grok-bot-0.47.0-1.x86_64.rpm\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\narm64: \u003ca href=\"https://downloads.cursor.com/grokbot/stable/c1e7d7a46549956d25f53e9c0b9f59666e03aa3a/linux/arm64/grok-bot-0.47.0-1.aarch64.rpm\"\u003ehttps://downloads.cursor.com/grokbot/stable/c1e7d7a46549956d25f53e9c0b9f59666e03aa3a/linux/arm64/grok-bot-0.47.0-1.aarch64.rpm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’d rather install from the package repo so dnf can handle updates:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode class=\"lang-auto\"\u003esudo tee /etc/yum.repos.d/grok-bot.repo \u0026lt;\u0026lt;'EOF'\n[grok-bot]\nname=Grok Bot\nbaseurl=https://downloads.cursor.com/yumrepo/grok-bot\nenabled=1\ngpgcheck=1\nrepo_gpgcheck=1\ngpgkey=https://downloads.cursor.com/keys/anysphere.asc\nEOF\nsudo dnf install grok-bot\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if either option gives you trouble.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-10T19:19:25.660Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171281,"topic_slug":"linux-rpm-links-for-grokbot-not-working","display_username":"Kevin Neilson","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden